Task: Fix question-bank insufficiency discovered during manual-QA Gate 3
Problem: science_quiz_questions had only 16 rows (3 G4 lessons); all 9
  G3 question seed files rejected by Zod validator.
Root cause: SeedQuizQuestionSchema only allowed options: z.array(z.string())
  and correctAnswer: scalar | string[]. VOCABULARY_MATCH uses options:
  {terms, definitions} object and correctAnswer: Record<string,string> map.
Fix: widen schema with z.union to accept both shapes; no runtime behavior
  change for existing types.
Verified: 320 G3 questions seeded; total 336 (was 16); 5 question types
  represented including 18 VOCABULARY_MATCH.
Behavior-preserving: existing types still validate; new shape additive.
